#: ../../source/guides/user/advanced/parallelism.md:1
msgid "Parallelism"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/user/advanced/parallelism.md:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Two independent levels, both automatic by default. This page is how to "
"drive them; *why* they are shaped this way, and the measurements that "
"cancelled two other levels, are in "
"{doc}`../../../reference/design/parallelism`."
msgstr ""

